{"id":1050504,"chapter_id":1050504,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"正式に授業が始まる日がやってきた。クロウはどうしても完成した教室で授業したいと主張したが、作業員たちに改装したばかりの教室は空気の汚れが酷いと言われて断念した。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"授業環境より、生徒たちの安全の方が遙かに重要である。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"そのためクロウは机や椅子を校舎の外のグラウンドに設置した。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"周囲を見回すと、各年齢層の子供が集まっている。8歳前後の子供もいれば、その倍くらいの歳の子供もいる。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"こういう不思議な光景を見られるのも、影の中に立つコンビクトに感謝しなければならない。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"口では嫌だと言いながらも、野良の子たち全員を学校に送ってきてくれた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"他にも、面白いものが見られる。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"一枚の入学願書に、大きくて歪な二つの文字——","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"ヘラだ。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"だがその本人は来ていない。あなたを嫌ったからだろうか？会った時に彼女が言いそうな言葉さえ想像できる。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"ヘラ","content":"ちょっと、なんでここにいるの？あたしを笑うために来たんじゃないでしょうね？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"content":"あなたは微笑んで願書を元の場所に戻し、風で飛ばぬようその上に石を置いてから、保護者のように最後列に座った。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"content":"授業開始時間から5分ほど過ぎたが、教壇には誰も立っていない。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"だが次の瞬間、その空の場所は猛ダッシュで飛び込んできた黒い影に占拠された。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"ごめんごめん……親愛なる生徒たちに最高の教科書を用意したいばかりに、少し遅れてしまった。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"生徒のみんな、今から何が起きても慌てないように。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"戸惑う生徒たちが疑問の視線をクロウに向けた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"学生A","content":"先生、何が起こるの？もしかして、爆発する？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"度胸のある生徒が手を挙げて質問した。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"えっと、そうだな……先生がみんなにサプライズを用意したんだ。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"大爆発に匹敵するくらいの、ね。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"話が終わらないうちに、一匹のカラスが一人の生徒の真上に飛んできた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"カラスは何度も旋回して机の上に降り、教科書を置くと急いで飛んでいった。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"コージ","content":"ふん、クソガラスが見せびらかしやがって。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"影の声が小さく響いたが、怒っているわけではないはずだ。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"生徒たちの驚きの視線が注がれる中、集まってきたカラスはあっという間に本の運搬を終えた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"これほど大げさな教科書運搬作業ができるのは、おそらくクロウしかいないだろう。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"さあ、親愛なる生徒諸君、シンジケート大学校の最初の授業を始めよう。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"私はクロウ。その響きが良くないと思う方にはもう一つの名を——","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"レイヴンだ。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"content":"授業は無事進んでいる。クロウがしっかり準備したおかげか、それともニューシティの教科書が魅力的なのか、あなたも興味津々に授業を聞いている。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504032,"trial_step":32},{"step":32,"content":"時間はあっという間に過ぎていき、まもなく歴史の授業の時間だ。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504033,"trial_step":33},{"step":33,"content":"授業が始まる前に、あなたは廊下で資料を持っているクロウを見かけた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504034,"trial_step":34},{"step":34,"options":["どうだ、準備の方は？"],"style":6,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"どうだ、準備の方は？","goto":36}]},{"step":35,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"準備していないと言ったら、信じるか？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504036,"trial_step":36},{"step":36,"speaker":"プレイヤー","content":"信じないな。","style":2,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504037,"trial_step":37},{"step":37,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"抜かりなく用意が済んだと言ったら？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504038,"trial_step":38},{"step":38,"speaker":"プレイヤー","content":"それも信じない。","style":2,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504039,"trial_step":39},{"step":39,"content":"クロウがニヤリと笑った。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504040,"trial_step":40},{"step":40,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"どうやらお互いの考えが分かるようになったようだな。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504041,"trial_step":41},{"step":41,"content":"クロウは意気揚々と教壇に戻ったが、あなたは近くでグラウンドの様子を黙って観察していた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504042,"trial_step":42},{"step":42,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"さあ、親愛なる生徒諸君。いよいよシンジケートにおける最初の歴史の授業が始まる。教科書を開いて。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504043,"trial_step":43},{"step":43,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"今日はシンジケートが誕生したN.F.81年からではなく、みんなが一番知っている年代の話をしよう。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504044,"trial_step":44},{"step":44,"content":"クロウはチョークを持って背を向け、黒板に長い線を引いて時間軸を描き始めた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504045,"trial_step":45},{"step":45,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"N.F.98年から始めよう。親愛なる生徒諸君、直ちに教科書を確認し、その年に何があったのかを教えてくれ。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504046,"trial_step":46},{"step":46,"content":"クロウが黒板に印を付けた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504047,"trial_step":47},{"step":47,"content":"ページがめくれる音の中で、クロウは目を閉じて回答を待っている。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504048,"trial_step":48},{"step":48,"speaker":"学生B","content":"先生！教科書に書いてなかった！","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504049,"trial_step":49},{"step":49,"speaker":"学生A","content":"そうだよ、この年のページは空白じゃないか。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504050,"trial_step":50},{"step":50,"content":"何人かの字が分かる生徒は辞書を使わずに教科書全体に目を通したようだが、N.F.98年の重大事件に関する記録は見つからなかった。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504051,"trial_step":51},{"step":51,"content":"クロウは生徒たちを座らせ、教科書をめくってから大げさに手を振った。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504052,"trial_step":52},{"step":52,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"はぁ、先生もトシだな。記憶違いをするなんて……","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504053,"trial_step":53},{"step":53,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"これは先生のミスだから、もう一度……","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504054,"trial_step":54},{"step":54,"speaker":"学生C","content":"先生。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504055,"trial_step":55},{"step":55,"content":"とある子供が静かに手を挙げた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504056,"trial_step":56},{"step":56,"speaker":"学生C","content":"知ってるよ、先生……本には書いてないけど、知ってる……かもしれない。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504057,"trial_step":57},{"step":57,"content":"驚いたクロウは興味深げに手を挙げた子供の方を向いた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504058,"trial_step":58},{"step":58,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"知っているのなら、大きな声でみんなに教えてあげてくれ。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504059,"trial_step":59},{"step":59,"speaker":"学生C","content":"うん。実は……自分はあまり知らなくて、お兄ちゃんから聞いたんだけど……その年、シンジケートにはすごい組織があったんだ、その名も……","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504060,"trial_step":60},{"step":60,"speaker":"学生C","content":"錆火だ！","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504061,"trial_step":61},{"step":61,"content":"その単語がすぐに授業の静寂を破った。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504062,"trial_step":62},{"step":62,"speaker":"学生A","content":"その時からもう錆火があったの？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504063,"trial_step":63},{"step":63,"speaker":"学生D","content":"嘘を言ってるんじゃないか？","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504064,"trial_step":64},{"step":64,"speaker":"学生B","content":"嘘じゃないと思うよ。確か、ドナルドのお兄ちゃんもその頃から入ったって……","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504065,"trial_step":65},{"step":65,"content":"クロウが教壇を叩いて静かにするよう合図した。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504066,"trial_step":66},{"step":66,"content":"それから彼女は手を振ると、鋭い音と共に——","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504067,"trial_step":67},{"step":67,"content":"その空白のページがクロウに引き裂かれ、風に乗って空に飛んだ。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504068,"trial_step":68},{"step":68,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"よし、素晴らしい回答だったよ。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504069,"trial_step":69},{"step":69,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"歴史とはね、人々が身をもって経験したことだ。それを経験した生徒がいる以上、その過去は間違いなく存在する。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504070,"trial_step":70},{"step":70,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"そこに書かれてある記録を認められない者は、その一ページを捨ててしまって構わない。","voice":["vo_trial_50504_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_raven_trial","style":1,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504071,"trial_step":71},{"step":71,"content":"あなたはクロウの表情を見つめ、彼女の本音を読み取ろうとする。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504072,"trial_step":72},{"step":72,"content":"しかしクロウはその暇を与えず、質問を続けた。","style":3,"background":1066,"log_type":1,"src_id":150504073,"trial_step":73},{"step":73,"speaker":"クロウ","content":"では、N.F.103年に起きた重大な事件は？","voice":["